    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runaway Bride \ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8</strong> is a chaotic, heartwarming, and slightly ridiculous escape adventure about choosing love, dodging family, and not tripping in heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Rachel</strong> \u2014 a strong, proud lesbian who just said <strong>&quot;I don\u2019t&quot;</strong> at the worst possible moment: right at the altar. Her traditional family is <i>not</i> thrilled. Cue the dramatic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, wearing a dress she didn't even pick, Rachel must sprint for her freedom while being chased by 10 <i>very determined</i> people \u2014 including Aunt Karen, an overenthusiastic cousin, and a surprisingly fast grandma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae What\u2019s the gameplay?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run like your future depends on it</strong> \u2014 because it kinda does</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid getting caught</strong> by friends &amp; relatives trying to drag you back to the wedding cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab the key</strong> that randomly appears to unlock the next level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through 10 unique levels</strong> full of surprises and passive-aggressive family energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get caught?</strong> Back to level one. The church bells are waiting... again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level gets harder, each key more elusive, and your family more dramatic. So stay light on your feet \u2014 and maybe pack running shoes under that gown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 What makes it special?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character chasing you has their own backstory, full of conflicting emotions, outdated opinions, or just really bad wedding behavior. Learn about them as you dodge them \u2014 or just leave them in the dust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Why it matters (and why it\u2019s funny):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underneath the running and chaos is a story about self-love, courage, and saying \u201cnope\u201d to a life that isn\u2019t yours. But also... it\u2019s a game where you <strong>dive-roll over flower girls and juke your uncle in a tux</strong>, so yeah, it\u2019s hilarious too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runaway Bride</strong> is fast, funny, heartfelt, and a little rebellious \u2014 just like Rachel.<br>Weddings are optional. Running is not.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runaway Bride \ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8</strong> is a chaotic, heartwarming, and slightly ridiculous escape adventure about choosing love, dodging family, and not tripping in heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Rachel</strong> \u2014 a strong, proud lesbian who just said <strong>&quot;I don\u2019t&quot;</strong> at the worst possible moment: right at the altar. Her traditional family is <i>not</i> thrilled. Cue the dramatic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, wearing a dress she didn't even pick, Rachel must sprint for her freedom while being chased by 10 <i>very determined</i> people \u2014 including Aunt Karen, an overenthusiastic cousin, and a surprisingly fast grandma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae What\u2019s the gameplay?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run like your future depends on it</strong> \u2014 because it kinda does</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid getting caught</strong> by friends &amp; relatives trying to drag you back to the wedding cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab the key</strong> that randomly appears to unlock the next level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through 10 unique levels</strong> full of surprises and passive-aggressive family energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get caught?</strong> Back to level one. The church bells are waiting... again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level gets harder, each key more elusive, and your family more dramatic. So stay light on your feet \u2014 and maybe pack running shoes under that gown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 What makes it special?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character chasing you has their own backstory, full of conflicting emotions, outdated opinions, or just really bad wedding behavior. Learn about them as you dodge them \u2014 or just leave them in the dust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Why it matters (and why it\u2019s funny):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underneath the running and chaos is a story about self-love, courage, and saying \u201cnope\u201d to a life that isn\u2019t yours. But also... it\u2019s a game where you <strong>dive-roll over flower girls and juke your uncle in a tux</strong>, so yeah, it\u2019s hilarious too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runaway Bride</strong> is fast, funny, heartfelt, and a little rebellious \u2014 just like Rachel.<br>Weddings are optional. Running is not.</p>",
